{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 2, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "My recent trip to Japan was a truly unforgettable experience. From the moment I arrived in Tokyo, I was struck by the city's vibrant energy and cutting-edge technology. I spent my days exploring the city's many neighborhoods, from the neon-lit streets of Shinjuku to the historic temples and gardens of Asakusa.\n\nOne of the highlights of my trip was visiting the famous Tsukiji Outer Market, where I sampled some of the freshest sushi I've ever had. I was also amazed by the efficiency and punctuality of Japan's public transportation system, which made it easy to get around the city.\n\nAs I traveled to other parts of the country, I was struck by the stunning natural beauty of Japan's landscapes. From the snow-capped mountains of the Japanese Alps to the serene gardens and temples of Kyoto, every destination was a feast for the eyes.\n\nDespite the many cultural and historical attractions, it was the Japanese people who made the biggest impression on me. Their kindness, politeness, and hospitality made me feel welcome and at home, even in a country where I didn't speak the language.\n\nOverall, my trip to Japan was a truly enriching experience that left me with many happy memories and a deep appreciation for this fascinating country. I'm already planning my next trip back!", "logprobs": [{"token": "My", "logprob": -0.47522157430648804}, {"token": " recent", "logprob": -0.0041772969998419285}, {"token": " trip", "logprob": -6.556489552167477e-06}, {"token": " to", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token": " was", "logprob": -6.437280717364047e-06}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.20426733791828156}, {"token": " truly", "logprob": -0.5806462168693542}, {"token": " unforgettable", "logprob": -0.0003682888636831194}, {"token": " experience", "logprob": -0.00020358874462544918}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.0